{% comment %}
  Size guide link — sits on the Size label row of the variant picker, as in
  the design ("Size: M            Size guide").

  Rendered from an LL edit in variant-main-picker.liquid. Shows only when the
  option is a size option and a size guide page is chosen in theme settings
  (Lighthouse Lane group). Renders nothing otherwise, so the edit is inert on
  colour rows, artwork framing options, and stores without the page set.

  Accepts:
  - option_name {String}: the product option's name, e.g. "UK Size".

  Usage:
  {% render 'll-size-guide-link', option_name: product_option.name %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign option_name_down = option_name | downcase
  assign guide_page = pages[settings.ll_size_guide_page]
-%}

{%- if option_name_down contains 'size' and guide_page != blank and guide_page.url != blank -%}
  <a class="ll-size-guide-link" href="{{ guide_page.url }}">
    {{- 'Size guide' -}}
  </a>
{%- endif -%}
